# The three settings. The Deploy to Cloudflare page asks for each of them (descriptions
# are in package.json). For a run on your PC, copy this file to .dev.vars and fill it in;
# .dev.vars is git-ignored. On GitHub Actions, set them in the repository settings instead.

# A second Zeekr account the car is shared with (not the one on your phone).
ZEEKR_EMAIL=
ZEEKR_PASSWORD=

# Up to 10 places where sentry mode is never turned on automatically, separated by ";".
# Each place: name, latitude, longitude, radius in metres (default 600), e.g.
#   Home, 1.3521, 103.8198, 600; Office, 1.2840, 103.8510, 600
# Required; write none for no places.
# Latitude/longitude: right-click the spot in Google Maps and click the numbers to copy them.
GEOFENCES=
